#: ../../source/4-reference/simulation/2-fasim_isaac.md:1
#: 5e563fa481f54b8096cf8f7f864647a4
msgid "FaSim-Isaac"
msgstr "FaSim-Isaac"

#: ../../source/4-reference/simulation/2-fasim_isaac.md:3
#: eca74de4c03e4b6784dc0c4cc67723e6
msgid ""
"FaSim-Isaac is the Isaac Sim workspace for this stack. It holds robot and"
" scene USD, can install an optional Isaac ROS 2 Jazzy overlay, and "
"installs two OmniGraph extensions: one starts 运控 inside Sim, and one "
"computes swerve (舵轮) commands for a chassis. It is not only a launcher "
"for opening a USD."
msgstr ""
"FaSim-Isaac 是 Isaac Sim 工作区：机器人和场景 USD、可选的 Isaac ROS 2 Jazzy 叠加，以及在 Sim "
"里启动运控的扩展。"

#: ../../source/4-reference/simulation/2-fasim_isaac.md:5
#: 969385b269184abd95f59253ef6a9f7c
msgid ""
"Use the [Isaac Sim How-To](../../2-how_to/2-simulation/4-isaac_sim.md) to"
" install, start Sim, pick a launch, and run the first checks. This page "
"explains the hardware keys, the two Kit extensions, and why a joint "
"topic, a clock, or a TF edge behaves the way it does."
msgstr "安装、启动 Sim、选择 launch 和第一次检查，请看 [Isaac Sim 操作说明](../../2-how_to/2-simulation/4-isaac_sim.md)。本页说明硬件键、两个 Kit 扩展，以及关节话题、时钟或 TF 边为什么会是现在这样。"

#: ../../source/4-reference/simulation/2-fasim_isaac.md:7
#: 7d0b00b451674b6389bf2645353c05d0
msgid ""
"**Repository:** [fiveages-sim/FaSim-Isaac](https://github.com/fiveages-"
"sim/FaSim-Isaac) `main` (`3606dc89`, 2026-11-13). In-process ros2_control"
" is on `main` ([#7](https://github.com/fiveages-sim/FaSim-Isaac/pull/7), "
"`1a4193a3`). The swerve extension is also on `main`. Replicator capture "
"(`exts/fasim.replicator.sdg`) is on `feature/ros2-control-node`, not on "
"`main`."
msgstr ""
"**仓库：** [fiveages-sim/FaSim-Isaac](https://github.com/fiveages-sim/FaSim-"
"Isaac) 的 `main`（`3606dc89`，2026-11-13）。进程内 ros2_control 在 `main` "
"上（[#7](https://github.com/fiveages-sim/FaSim-"
"Isaac/pull/7)，`1a4193a3`）。Replicator 采集（`exts/fasim.replicator.sdg`）在 "
"`feature/ros2-control-node`，不在 `main`。"

#: ../../source/4-reference/simulation/2-fasim_isaac.md:9
#: df98c599037c4b2a9f328dc6cd02a487
msgid ""
"**README:** [README.md](https://github.com/fiveages-sim/FaSim-"
"Isaac/blob/main/README.md)"
msgstr ""
"**README：** [README.md](https://github.com/fiveages-sim/FaSim-"
"Isaac/blob/main/README.md)"

#: ../../source/4-reference/simulation/2-fasim_isaac.md:13
#: 87c1ba509dd249a984837f41854d8176
msgid "Hardware keys `isaac` and `isaac_sim`"
msgstr "硬件键 `isaac` 和 `isaac_sim`"

#: ../../source/4-reference/simulation/2-fasim_isaac.md:15
#: 7d444f061a2743d4a8477f62bb37c0db
msgid ""
"These keys are ros2_control hardware interfaces in the robot description "
"xacro. They are not the FaSim Kit extensions below, and they are not a "
"second robot body. One stage uses one of them."
msgstr "这两个键是机器人描述 xacro 里的 ros2_control 硬件接口。它们不是下面的 FaSim Kit 扩展，也不是第二台机器人。一个舞台只用其中一种。"

#: ../../source/4-reference/simulation/2-fasim_isaac.md:17
#: b40ecb01267e4e289943838e45605173
msgid ""
"`isaac` is the topic bridge you pass on a ROS 2 launch. `isaac_sim` is "
"set inside Isaac when Play starts the in-process node. It is not a "
"`demo.launch.py` flag."
msgstr ""
"一个舞台用下面两种之一。`isaac` 是你在 ROS 2 launch 上传的话题桥。`isaac_sim` 是 Play 启动进程内节点时在 "
"Isaac 里设置的。它不是 `demo.launch.py` 的参数，也不是第二台机器人。"

