msgid ""
"Turn a planar twist into steer-position and wheel-velocity commands for a"
" four-wheel swerve chassis"
msgstr "把平面速度旋量换成四轮舵轮底盘的转向位置指令和轮速指令"

#: ../../source/4-reference/simulation/2-fasim_isaac.md:51
#: d27f8bddeac74aeaa5799971a50da2be
msgid "ROS 2 Control extension"
msgstr "ROS 2 Control 扩展"

#: ../../source/4-reference/simulation/2-fasim_isaac.md:53
#: 10c024494a6f4f4da5e4eb8728e1547b
msgid ""
"`fasim.ros2.nodes` is the in-process 运控 entry. After Play, "
"`OgnROS2ControlLaunch` ([`OgnROS2ControlLaunch.ogn`](https://github.com"
"/fiveages-sim/FaSim-"
"Isaac/blob/main/exts/fasim.ros2.nodes/fasim/ros2/nodes/ogn/python/nodes/OgnROS2ControlLaunch.ogn))"
" runs once and calls `emit_control`. That path sets `hardware=isaac_sim`,"
" passes the ArticulationRoot as `isaac_prim_path`, and starts Isaac’s "
"ControllerManager in the same process. Examples on this path include G1D,"
" G1, and W2. W2’s in-process payload is "
"[`W2/payloads/ROS/fiveages.usda`](https://github.com/fiveages-sim"
"/fiveages-gen2-robot-usds/blob/main/W2/payloads/ROS/fiveages.usda)."
msgstr "`fasim.ros2.nodes` 是进程内运控的入口。Play 之后，`OgnROS2ControlLaunch`（[`OgnROS2ControlLaunch.ogn`](https://github.com/fiveages-sim/FaSim-Isaac/blob/main/exts/fasim.ros2.nodes/fasim/ros2/nodes/ogn/python/nodes/OgnROS2ControlLaunch.ogn)）运行一次并调用 `emit_control`。这条路径会设置 `hardware=isaac_sim`，把 ArticulationRoot 作为 `isaac_prim_path` 传入，并在同一进程里启动 Isaac 的 ControllerManager。走这条路径的例子包括 G1D、G1 和 W2。W2 的进程内 payload 是 [`W2/payloads/ROS/fiveages.usda`](https://github.com/fiveages-sim/fiveages-gen2-robot-usds/blob/main/W2/payloads/ROS/fiveages.usda)。"

#: ../../source/4-reference/simulation/2-fasim_isaac.md:55
#: aa6e0bacb47742cabe5e4d80abbd5ad4
msgid ""
"This is not the topic-bridge path. A stage that only uses "
"`hardware:=isaac` does not go through this node."
msgstr "这不是话题桥路径。只使用 `hardware:=isaac` 的舞台不会经过这个节点。"

