msgid "`robot_common_launch` arms xacro key. Empty keeps the description default"
msgstr "OCS2 `.info` 的文件名。为空则保留描述包默认值"

#: ../../source/4-reference/simulation/2-fasim_isaac.md:75
#: d93143e748484bb7ac4bacd02be8b121
msgid ""
"`emit_control` builds one xacro URDF and points both the controller "
"manager and `/robot_description` at it. `Ros2ControlManager.setup` is "
"called with `publish_robot_description=False`, so the manager does not "
"publish that topic a second time. `robot_state_publisher` on the host "
"publishes `/robot_description` and the URDF TF tree. If that process does"
" not start, a latched `fasim_robot_description` publisher is the "
"fallback. The resource manager therefore loads the description once."
msgstr ""
"`emit_control` 生成一份 xacro URDF，并让控制器管理器和 `/robot_description` "
"都指向它。`Ros2ControlManager.setup` 以 `publish_robot_description=False` "
"调用，所以管理器不会再发一次这个话题。主机上的 `robot_state_publisher` 发布 `/robot_description` 和"
" URDF 的 TF 树。这个进程没起来时，锁存的 `fasim_robot_description` "
"发布者作为后备。资源管理器因此只加载一次描述。"

#: ../../source/4-reference/simulation/2-fasim_isaac.md:77
#: e0940c7fc3c740f3b39f7810f34ef886
msgid ""
"Play does not rebuild a URDF from the stage on every start. The node "
"reuses the description xacro, and it falls back to synthesizing a URDF "
"from the USD only for an unexpected prim."
msgstr "Play 不会在每次启动时从舞台重新生成 URDF。节点复用描述 xacro，只有遇到意外图元时才退回去从 USD 合成 URDF。"

#: ../../source/4-reference/simulation/2-fasim_isaac.md:79
#: 6eb8c090c95a46f0a02ca6177a5cc297
msgid "CppAD cache"
msgstr "CppAD 缓存"

#: ../../source/4-reference/simulation/2-fasim_isaac.md:81
#: 23194477795d414c8432ed894cbbb31b
#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"`ocs2_arm_controller` declares `recompile_libraries` with default true "
"when `task.info` does not set `recompileLibraries` "
"([`CtrlComponent.h`](https://github.com/fiveages-"
"sim/arms_ros2_control/blob/main/controller/ocs2_arm_controller/include/ocs2_arm_controller/control/CtrlComponent.h))."
" The library folder is "
"`${OCS2_PLANNING_URDF_DIR:-/tmp}/ocs2_ros2/<robot>/ocs2/<content-hash>`."
msgstr ""
"`ocs2_arm_controller` 在 `task.info` 没有设置 `recompileLibraries` 时，把 "
"`recompile_libraries` 的默认值声明为 true（[`CtrlComponent.h`](https://github.com"
"/fiveages-"
"sim/arms_ros2_control/blob/main/controller/ocs2_arm_controller/include/ocs2_arm_controller/control/CtrlComponent.h)）。库目录是"
" `${OCS2_PLANNING_URDF_DIR:-/tmp}/ocs2_ros2/<robot>/ocs2/<content-hash>`。"

#: ../../source/4-reference/simulation/2-fasim_isaac.md:83
#: e6e162b0315843dabcb88169f2cbd636
msgid ""
"On the in-process path, `emit_control` then sets `recompile_libraries: "
"false` on the main controller only: `ocs2_arm_controller` for `demo` and "
"`split_body`, `ocs2_wbc_controller` for `full_body`. A topic-bridge "
"launch (`hardware:=isaac`) does not run `emit_control`, so it keeps the "
"controller default. That default stays true unless that robot’s info file"
" or YAML already says false."
msgstr ""
"在进程内这条路径上，`emit_control` 接着只把主控制器的 `recompile_libraries` 设为 false：`demo` "
"和 `split_body` 是 `ocs2_arm_controller`，`full_body` 是 "
"`ocs2_wbc_controller`。话题桥 launch（`hardware:=isaac`）不跑 "
"`emit_control`，所以保留控制器默认值。除非这台机器人的 info 或 YAML 已经写成 false，否则默认仍是 true。"

#: ../../source/4-reference/simulation/2-fasim_isaac.md:85
#: c58ffa2498944925ad9562d0540035e6
msgid ""
"A simulated robot that runs 运控 inside Isaac starts faster for two "
"reasons: the node reuses the description xacro, and it reuses this CppAD "
"cache."
msgstr "仿真机器人在 Isaac 里跑运控时，启动更快有两个原因：节点复用描述 xacro，并且复用这份 CppAD 缓存。"

#: ../../source/4-reference/simulation/2-fasim_isaac.md:87
#: d5930563f2334e75a59a17bba900cf24
msgid "`infoFile` and `BASE_LOCK`"
msgstr "`infoFile` 与 `BASE_LOCK`"

#: ../../source/4-reference/simulation/2-fasim_isaac.md:89
#: 87b4fd93182443beb19d912aa3c75392
msgid ""
"`infoFile` overrides `info_file_name` on the main controller. "
"`fixed_base_tcp` drops the virtual chassis degrees of freedom "
"(`manipulatorModelType` 0), so whole-body planning covers the body and "
"the arms."
msgstr ""
"`infoFile` 覆盖主控制器上的 `info_file_name`。`fixed_base_tcp` "
"去掉虚拟底盘自由度（`manipulatorModelType` 为 0），全身规划就只覆盖身体和手臂。"

#: ../../source/4-reference/simulation/2-fasim_isaac.md:91
#: 636757671d4748e2b0eb3ff390e52fc5
msgid ""
"`emit_control` warns when `mode` is `full_body` and the override name "
"contains `fixed_base`. The planner then has `basePlan=0`, so a runtime "
"`BASE_LOCK` has nothing to constrain, and arm enable can stay in "
"`WAITING_FOR_ENABLE_POLICY`. Lock the base with `mobile_base_tcp` and "
"`BASE_LOCK`."
msgstr ""
"`mode` 是 `full_body` 且覆盖文件名含有 `fixed_base` 时，`emit_control` 会警告。此时规划器 "
"`basePlan=0`，运行时的 `BASE_LOCK` 没有东西可约束，手臂使能会停在 "
"`WAITING_FOR_ENABLE_POLICY`。锁底盘用 `mobile_base_tcp` 和 `BASE_LOCK`。"

#: ../../source/4-reference/simulation/2-fasim_isaac.md:93
#: fbeaf3f339bb4c00ad1e45f8bc4f55de
msgid ""
"`full_body` loads `ocs2_wbc_controller` from the GitHub Release package "
"`ros-jazzy-arms-ros2-control` (`./init_repo.sh` with arms set to `d`, or "
"`./scripts/install_core_debs.sh --only arms`). The same package contains "
"`ocs2_humanoid` and `lina_planning`. It is not an apt package, and it is "
"not `ros-jazzy-arms-ros2-control-full`. Open [ocs2-wbc-"
"controller](https://github.com/fiveages-sim/ocs2-wbc-controller) when you"
" need to read or change the source. You can run the controller from the "
"deb without that private source checkout."
msgstr ""
"`full_body` 从 GitHub Release 包 `ros-jazzy-arms-ros2-control` 加载 "
"`ocs2_wbc_controller`（`./init_repo.sh` 里 arms 选 `d`，或 "
"`./scripts/install_core_debs.sh --only arms`）。同一个包里还有 `ocs2_humanoid` 和 "
"`lina_planning`。它不是 apt 包，也不是 `ros-jazzy-arms-ros2-control-"
"full`。要读源码或改源码时再打开 [ocs2-wbc-controller](https://github.com/fiveages-"
"sim/ocs2-wbc-controller)。"

#: ../../source/4-reference/simulation/2-fasim_isaac.md:95
#: 49d25293272c4a63936d33224fae5a98
msgid "Add a robot to the in-process path"
msgstr "把一台机器人接到进程内路径"

#: ../../source/4-reference/simulation/2-fasim_isaac.md:97
#: 6d2d5bdf30cc46a2a7cf273636583f39
#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"The `{robot}_description` xacro includes `simulation_hardware_plugin` for"
" `isaac_sim`, or lists `isaac_sim` in `validated_hardware_type` if that "
"robot uses a whitelist."
msgstr "`{robot}_description` 的 xacro 为 `isaac_sim` 包含 `simulation_hardware_plugin`；如果该机用了白名单，还要把 `isaac_sim` 写进 `validated_hardware_type`。"

#: ../../source/4-reference/simulation/2-fasim_isaac.md:98
#: f64003369ffa4acf9ac03b0d8767065b
msgid ""
"The USD has one ArticulationRoot and a payload that contains "
"`ROS2ControlLaunch`. Set `targetPrim`, `robot` or the `Robot` variant, "
"and `mode`."
msgstr "USD 里有一个 ArticulationRoot，以及包含 `ROS2ControlLaunch` 的 payload。设置 `targetPrim`、`robot` 或 `Robot` 变体，以及 `mode`。"

#: ../../source/4-reference/simulation/2-fasim_isaac.md:99
#: 3f1e37fe34784c8ea1909b8e60e09055
msgid ""
"Operation 5 is installed and Isaac was restarted. The ROS variant on the "
"stage is the in-process payload, not the topic-bridge payload."
msgstr "已完成操作 5，并且重启过 Isaac。舞台上的 `ROS` 变体是进程内 payload，不是话题桥 payload。"

#: ../../source/4-reference/simulation/2-fasim_isaac.md:100
#: 9e1fb9bd5a1742c5970ace8182ee82a2
msgid ""
"Press Play, then check as in the [How-"
"To](../../2-how_to/2-simulation/4-isaac_sim.md#in-process-hardware-"
"interface-isaac_sim)."
msgstr "按 Play，然后按 [How-To](../../2-how_to/2-simulation/4-isaac_sim.md#in-process-hardware-interface-isaac_sim) 检查。"

#: ../../source/4-reference/simulation/2-fasim_isaac.md:102
#: ../../source/4-reference/simulation/2-fasim_isaac.md:143
#: 0f78cfd1cad14d06898385680482c353 241daa096a4f46259d5a155e48f094b2
msgid "What you should see"
msgstr "你应该看到什么"

#: ../../source/4-reference/simulation/2-fasim_isaac.md:104
#: c5c45f45519743e8aee3294140cb93db
msgid ""
"`ros2 control list_controllers` lists the controllers for that `mode`. "
"`/joint_states` is the controller’s `joint_state_broadcaster`, not the "
"topic-bridge `/isaac/joint_*` pair. `/clock` ticks near the physics rate "
"(see [Clock](#clock)). A command moves the articulation in the "
"viewport. Arm degrees of freedom are not also bridged on "
"`/isaac/joint_command`."
msgstr "`ros2 control list_controllers` 会列出该 `mode` 下的控制器。这里的 `/joint_states` 来自控制器的 `joint_state_broadcaster`，不是话题桥的 `/isaac/joint_*`。`/clock` 的频率应接近物理步（见 [时钟](#clock)）。一条指令能在视口里带动 articulation。手臂自由度不会再走 `/isaac/joint_command` 桥接。"

#: ../../source/4-reference/simulation/2-fasim_isaac.md:108
#: 902523f3bdc2499ea3251b20040464bf
msgid "Swerve extension"
msgstr "舵轮扩展"

#: ../../source/4-reference/simulation/2-fasim_isaac.md:110
#: 2da0e7befbf44989aa2ea9e10847021b
msgid ""
"`fasim.steering.nodes` provides `fasim.steering.nodes.SwerveController` "
"([`OgnSwerveController.ogn`](https://github.com/fiveages-sim/FaSim-"
"Isaac/blob/main/exts/fasim.steering.nodes/fasim/steering/nodes/ogn/python/nodes/OgnSwerveController.ogn),"
" kinematics in [`swerve.py`](https://github.com/fiveages-sim/FaSim-"
"Isaac/blob/main/exts/fasim.steering.nodes/fasim/steering/nodes/swerve.py))."
" It is an OmniGraph node, not a ros2_control hardware interface. A "
"ScriptNode used to hold the same kinematics in module globals, which made"
" Isaac disable every Action Graph until the user opted in. This node "
"keeps state on the instance instead."
msgstr "`fasim.steering.nodes` 提供 `fasim.steering.nodes.SwerveController`（[`OgnSwerveController.ogn`](https://github.com/fiveages-sim/FaSim-Isaac/blob/main/exts/fasim.steering.nodes/fasim/steering/nodes/ogn/python/nodes/OgnSwerveController.ogn)，运动学在 [`swerve.py`](https://github.com/fiveages-sim/FaSim-Isaac/blob/main/exts/fasim.steering.nodes/fasim/steering/nodes/swerve.py)）。它是 OmniGraph 节点，不是 ros2_control 硬件接口。以前用 ScriptNode 把同一套运动学放在模块全局变量里，Isaac 会因此关掉所有 Action Graph，直到用户授权。现在状态保存在实例上。"

#: ../../source/4-reference/simulation/2-fasim_isaac.md:112
#: 0ecd99179bdb480da6a794727f9020c9
msgid ""
"It reads a planar twist in the body frame and writes two arrays, in the "
"same wheel order: front-left, rear-left, rear-right, front-right (`fl`, "
"`rl`, `rr`, `fr`)."
msgstr "它读取机体坐标系下的平面速度旋量，并写出两组数组，轮序相同：左前、左后、右后、右前（`fl`、`rl`、`rr`、`fr`）。"

#: ../../source/4-reference/simulation/2-fasim_isaac.md:114
#: 10eacbdf821a46b69e4652ca80dad593
msgid ""
"`Steer_Position_Command` and `Steer_Joints` — steer angles, in radians, "
"sent as position commands"
msgstr "`Steer_Position_Command` 和 `Steer_Joints` — 转向角，单位弧度，作为位置指令发出"

#: ../../source/4-reference/simulation/2-fasim_isaac.md:115
#: e6a1df3659084776836216595e553ea0
msgid ""
"`Wheel_Velocity_Command` and `Wheel_Joints` — wheel velocity commands, "
"sent as velocity commands"
msgstr "`Wheel_Velocity_Command` 和 `Wheel_Joints` — 轮速指令，作为速度指令发出"

#: ../../source/4-reference/simulation/2-fasim_isaac.md:117
#: b9cfb55fd4614afc9917ea35594f171f
msgid ""
"The two command types go to two "
"`isaacsim.core.nodes.IsaacArticulationController` nodes. Do not wire "
"steer angles as wheel velocities, or the other way around."
msgstr "这两类指令分别进入两个 `isaacsim.core.nodes.IsaacArticulationController` 节点。不要把转向角接到轮速上，也不要反过来接。"

#: ../../source/4-reference/simulation/2-fasim_isaac.md:119
#: 5cc9ac2b11fd440fb56ec041ae7a3518
msgid ""
"`Desired_Linear_Velocity_X` / `Y` are forward and lateral speed in metres"
" per second. `Desired_Angular_Velocity` is yaw rate in radians per "
"second. Wheel positions in the profiles are body-frame `(x, y)` in "
"metres, with `x` forward and `y` left. Inverse kinematics use `vx_total ="
" vx - ω y_i` and `vy_total = vy + ω x_i`."
msgstr "`Desired_Linear_Velocity_X` / `Y` 是前进和侧向速度，单位米每秒。`Desired_Angular_Velocity` 是偏航角速度，单位弧度每秒。各 profile 里的轮位是机体坐标系下的 `(x, y)`，单位米，`x` 向前、`y` 向左。逆运动学使用 `vx_total = vx - ω y_i` 和 `vy_total = vy + ω x_i`。"

#: ../../source/4-reference/simulation/2-fasim_isaac.md:121
#: 10aa2b7f27a14df690d2e82a5fa073e9
msgid ""
"`linearGain` scales wheel speed after the inverse kinematics. "
"`angularGain` scales yaw rate before it. `flipVelocityScale` (clamped to "
"`[0, 1]`) scales wheel speed for one frame when the equivalent steer "
"solution flips sign. `simTime` is unused; it remains so existing Taku "
"graph connections still resolve."
msgstr "`linearGain` 在逆运动学之后缩放轮速。`angularGain` 在逆运动学之前缩放偏航角速度。`flipVelocityScale`（限制在 `[0, 1]`）在等效转向解翻转符号的那一帧缩放轮速。`simTime` 未被使用，保留它是为了让现有 Taku 图上的连接仍然能解析。"

#: ../../source/4-reference/simulation/2-fasim_isaac.md:123
#: 2e56a206147841959acded8735e1e2a4
msgid ""
"The node accepts only two profiles. An unknown `profile` raises "
"`ValueError`. There is no separate profile YAML."
msgstr "节点只接受两种 profile。未知的 `profile` 会抛出 `ValueError`。没有单独的 profile YAML。"

#: ../../source/4-reference/simulation/2-fasim_isaac.md
