"`agv_left_front_steering_joint`, `agv_left_back_steering_joint`, "
"`agv_right_back_steering_joint`, `agv_right_front_steering_joint`"
msgstr "`agv_left_front_steering_joint`、`agv_left_back_steering_joint`、`agv_right_back_steering_joint`、`agv_right_front_steering_joint`"

#: ../../source/4-reference/simulation/2-fasim_isaac.md
#: ddf0ff3c8c8441deaa8d24ccd2d36379
msgid ""
"`agv_left_front_rotate_joint`, `agv_left_back_rotate_joint`, "
"`agv_right_back_rotate_joint`, `agv_right_front_rotate_joint`"
msgstr "`agv_left_front_rotate_joint`、`agv_left_back_rotate_joint`、`agv_right_back_rotate_joint`、`agv_right_front_rotate_joint`"

#: ../../source/4-reference/simulation/2-fasim_isaac.md
#: 5ea850eb751d42d3bc6a22cdabee41c3
msgid ""
"`(0.2745, 0.2045)`, `(-0.2745, 0.2045)`, `(-0.2745, -0.2045)`, `(0.2745, "
"-0.2045)`"
msgstr "`(0.2745, 0.2045)`、`(-0.2745, 0.2045)`、`(-0.2745, -0.2045)`、`(0.2745, -0.2045)`"

#: ../../source/4-reference/simulation/2-fasim_isaac.md
#: 901337c6cfc04f9699ed5a8141e37b64
msgid ""
"On stop, steer holds; steer slew is limited to 180°/s; wheel speed is "
"scaled down until the steer error is small (full speed at 8°, zero at "
"35°). `msgCount` must keep changing: if it is unchanged for 0.25 s, the "
"last twist is dropped. Linear deadband 0.02 m/s, yaw deadband 0.05 rad/s."
" Flip choice uses a 20° hysteresis. `deltaSeconds` is the playback frame "
"dt (values `≤ 1e-6` or `> 0.1` fall back to `1/60`)"
msgstr "停车时转向角保持不变；转向角速度限制为 180°/s；转向误差变小之前会降低轮速（误差 8° 时全速度，35° 时为零）。`msgCount` 必须持续变化：若 0.25 秒没有变化，就丢掉上一条 twist。线速度死区 0.02 m/s，偏航死区 0.05 rad/s。翻转选择带 20° 回差。`deltaSeconds` 是回放帧的 dt（`≤ 1e-6` 或 `> 0.1` 时回退为 `1/60`）"

#: ../../source/4-reference/simulation/2-fasim_isaac.md:130
#: f187318e7a994ae6b72fddfd504fff5a
msgid "Graph wiring on current assets"
msgstr "当前资产里的图连接"

#: ../../source/4-reference/simulation/2-fasim_isaac.md:132
#: d4ccdcdbdf2746af803d2e08c44f5bf2
msgid ""
"Both example graphs tick from `OnPlaybackTick`, subscribe to a "
"`geometry_msgs/Twist` with `ROS2SubscribeTwist`, break out linear `x`/`y`"
" and angular `z`, and run `SwerveController`. Linear velocity is passed "
"through `OgnIsaacScaleToFromStageUnit`."
msgstr "两个示例图都由 `OnPlaybackTick` 触发，用 `ROS2SubscribeTwist` 订阅 `geometry_msgs/Twist`，拆出线速度 `x`/`y` 和角速度 `z`，再进入 `SwerveController`。线速度会经过 `OgnIsaacScaleToFromStageUnit`。"

#: ../../source/4-reference/simulation/2-fasim_isaac.md:134
#: 03c06d9c737c4f219b033c0413922425
msgid ""
"Linkhou S2: "
"[`mobile_base/Linkhou/S2_V1/payloads/ROS/ros2.usda`](https://github.com"
"/fiveages-"
"sim/robot_usds/blob/main/mobile_base/Linkhou/S2_V1/payloads/ROS/ros2.usda),"
" graph `ROS_Steering_Controller`, `profile` `linkhou_s2_v1`. `linearGain`"
" is 14.28, `angularGain` is 1.04. The ArticulationRoot target is "
"`</Linkhou_S2_V1>`. Joint name arrays come from the node outputs "
"`Steer_Joints` and `Wheel_Joints`. The `ROS2SubscribeTwist` `topicName` "
"attribute is present in that USDA but has no value; confirm the topic on "
"the opened stage before you publish."
msgstr "Linkhou S2：[`mobile_base/Linkhou/S2_V1/payloads/ROS/ros2.usda`](https://github.com/fiveages-sim/robot_usds/blob/main/mobile_base/Linkhou/S2_V1/payloads/ROS/ros2.usda)，图是 `ROS_Steering_Controller`，`profile` 为 `linkhou_s2_v1`。`linearGain` 为 14.28，`angularGain` 为 1.04。ArticulationRoot 目标是 `</Linkhou_S2_V1>`。关节名数组来自节点输出 `Steer_Joints` 和 `Wheel_Joints`。这份 USDA 里声明了 `ROS2SubscribeTwist` 的 `topicName`，但没有赋值；发布前先在打开的舞台上确认话题名。"

#: ../../source/4-reference/simulation/2-fasim_isaac.md:135
#: deabc356d517426c8870efd656bf1356
msgid ""
"Taku: "
"[`humanoid/Dyna/Taku/components/Taku_Chassis/payloads/Graph/enable.usda`](https://github.com"
"/fiveages-"
"sim/robot_usds/blob/main/humanoid/Dyna/Taku/components/Taku_Chassis/payloads/Graph/enable.usda),"
" graph `steering_wheel_controller`, `profile` `taku`. `topicName` is "
"`/cmd_vel`. `linearGain` is 16, `flipVelocityScale` is 0.15, "
"`angularGain` is 1. `deltaSeconds` comes from `OnPlaybackTick`, "
"`msgCount` from a Counter on the subscriber `execOut`, and `simTime` from"
" `IsaacReadSimulationTime` (the node does not use that last input). The "
"ArticulationRoot target is `</Taku_Chassis/base_link>`. The two "
"`IsaacArticulationController` nodes list the steer and drive joint names "
"explicitly, in the same `fl`, `rl`, `rr`, `fr` order as the profile."
msgstr "Taku：[`humanoid/Dyna/Taku/components/Taku_Chassis/payloads/Graph/enable.usda`](https://github.com/fiveages-sim/robot_usds/blob/main/humanoid/Dyna/Taku/components/Taku_Chassis/payloads/Graph/enable.usda)，图是 `steering_wheel_controller`，`profile` 为 `taku`。`topicName` 是 `/cmd_vel`。`linearGain` 为 16，`flipVelocityScale` 为 0.15，`angularGain` 为 1。`deltaSeconds` 来自 `OnPlaybackTick`，`msgCount` 来自订阅节点 `execOut` 上的 Counter，`simTime` 来自 `IsaacReadSimulationTime`（节点并不使用最后这项输入）。ArticulationRoot 目标是 `</Taku_Chassis/base_link>`。两个 `IsaacArticulationController` 节点显式列出转向和驱动关节名，顺序与 profile 一样，是 `fl`、`rl`、`rr`、`fr`。"

#: ../../source/4-reference/simulation/2-fasim_isaac.md:137
#: 1f699387269141a0a653b3839ba6af68
msgid ""
"OGN defaults, if a graph leaves them unset, are `linearGain` 50, "
"`angularGain` 1, and `flipVelocityScale` 0.35."
msgstr "如果图没有设置这些值，OGN 默认是 `linearGain` 50、`angularGain` 1、`flipVelocityScale` 0.35。"

#: ../../source/4-reference/simulation/2-fasim_isaac.md:139
#: f103a35c5ed44167b22d062f99f7ad6d
msgid "Add a swerve chassis"
msgstr "接入一套舵轮底盘"

#: ../../source/4-reference/simulation/2-fasim_isaac.md:141
#: df0a32f8fb25455489a7523d543637c2
msgid ""
"A new chassis is not configured by pointing `profile` at a file. Add a "
"profile in [`swerve.py`](https://github.com/fiveages-sim/FaSim-"
"Isaac/blob/main/exts/fasim.steering.nodes/fasim/steering/nodes/swerve.py):"
" wheel `(x, y)`, steer and drive joint names, and the stop behaviour that"
" chassis needs. List the token in the OGN `allowedTokens`. Copy a graph "
"from Linkhou S2 or Taku: subscribe a twist, set `profile`, and connect "
"steer positions and wheel velocities to two `IsaacArticulationController`"
" nodes on the ArticulationRoot. Joint names on those controllers, or on "
"the node outputs, must match the USD and the profile, in `fl`, `rl`, "
"`rr`, `fr` order. Install operation 5 and restart Isaac so "
"`SwerveController` is available."
msgstr "新底盘不是靠把 `profile` 指到某个文件来配置的。要在 [`swerve.py`](https://github.com/fiveages-sim/FaSim-Isaac/blob/main/exts/fasim.steering.nodes/fasim/steering/nodes/swerve.py) 里增加 profile：轮位 `(x, y)`、转向和驱动关节名，以及这套底盘需要的停车行为。把该 token 写进 OGN 的 `allowedTokens`。从图上仿 Linkhou S2 或 Taku：订阅 twist，设置 `profile`，再把转向位置和轮速接到 ArticulationRoot 上的两个 `IsaacArticulationController`。这些控制器上的关节名，或节点输出的关节名，必须与 USD 和 profile 一致，顺序是 `fl`、`rl`、`rr`、`fr`。安装操作 5 并重启 Isaac，`SwerveController` 才会可用。"

#: ../../source/4-reference/simulation/2-fasim_isaac.md:145
#: 048c1ad99d2c4eb685c4482d3ffed402
msgid ""
"After Play, a `geometry_msgs/Twist` on the graph’s subscribe topic moves "
"the chassis. Steer joints follow `Steer_Position_Command`; wheel joints "
"follow `Wheel_Velocity_Command`. On Linkhou S2, a zero command snaps the "
"steer joints to zero. On Taku, the steer joints hold, and a stale command"
" (no new `msgCount` for 0.25 s) stops the wheels. If the node type is "
"missing, operation 5 was not installed or Isaac was not restarted."
msgstr "Play 之后，往图的订阅话题发一条 `geometry_msgs/Twist`，底盘就会动。转向关节跟随 `Steer_Position_Command`，驱动关节跟随 `Wheel_Velocity_Command`。在 Linkhou S2 上，零指令会把转向关节打到零。在 Taku 上，转向关节保持角度，过期指令（0.25 秒没有新的 `msgCount`）会让轮子停下来。如果节点类型不存在，说明还没做操作 5，或没有重启 Isaac。"

#: ../../source/4-reference/simulation/2-fasim_isaac.md:149
#: c6ed91a2384a474e95fa3f4ea0b73458
msgid "Clock"
msgstr "Clock"

#: ../../source/4-reference/simulation/2-fasim_isaac.md:151
#: 726d4357949042a8a326aeb6a2dff0a6
msgid ""
"In-process W2 publishes `/clock` from a separate on-demand graph "
"`ROS_Clock`: `evaluationMode=OnDemand`, "
"`pipelineStage=pipelineStageOnDemand`, `OnPhysicsStep` → `PublishClock`, "
"`IsaacReadSimulationTime` with `resetOnStop=1` "
"([`fiveages.usda`](https://github.com/fiveages-sim/fiveages-gen2-robot-"
"usds/blob/main/W2/payloads/ROS/fiveages.usda)). `OnPhysicsStep` does not "
"run in the automatic `ROS_Control` graph, so the clock graph stays beside"
" it. `ROS_Control` still uses `OnPlaybackTick` to start "
"`ROS2ControlLaunch` once."
msgstr ""
"进程内的 W2 用旁边单独的 `ROS_Clock` 图发布 "
"`/clock`：`evaluationMode=OnDemand`，`pipelineStage=pipelineStageOnDemand`，`OnPhysicsStep`"
" → `PublishClock`，`IsaacReadSimulationTime` 的 "
"`resetOnStop=1`（[`fiveages.usda`](https://github.com/fiveages-sim"
"/fiveages-gen2-robot-"
"usds/blob/main/W2/payloads/ROS/fiveages.usda`)）。`OnPhysicsStep` 不会在自动的 "
"`ROS_Control` 图里跑，所以时钟图放在旁边。`ROS_Control` 仍用 `OnPlaybackTick` 把 "
"`ROS2ControlLaunch` 启动一次。"

#: ../../source/4-reference/simulation/2-fasim_isaac.md:153
#: 1680c8a74b9c42a6a0fc2c943e279488
msgid ""
"The topic-bridge payload on the same robot "
"([`ros2.usda`](https://github.com/fiveages-sim/fiveages-gen2-robot-"
"usds/blob/main/W2/payloads/ROS/ros2.usda)) still drives `PublishClock` "
"from `OnPlaybackTick` and sets `resetOnStop=0`."
msgstr ""
"同一台机器人的话题桥载荷（[`ros2.usda`](https://github.com/fiveages-sim/fiveages-gen2"
"-robot-usds/blob/main/W2/payloads/ROS/ros2.usda)）仍从 `OnPlaybackTick` 驱动 "
"`PublishClock`，并把 `resetOnStop` 设为 0。"

#: ../../source/4-reference/simulation/2-fasim_isaac.md:155
#: 7407de67a5e44de483381efecfc38a29
msgid ""
"`/clock` is the controller’s time base when `use_sim_time` is true. A "
"clock that ticks once per rendered frame jumps several physics steps, so "
"a timed move finishes early. Use the physics-step clock. Changing joint "
"gains does not fix that. New in-process payloads follow the same "
"`ROS_Clock` pattern. This page checks it on W2. Odometry graphs keep "
"their own `ReadSimTime` (`resetOnStop=1`) so `odom` stamps stay valid. "
"Put cameras on the scene payload, not on this clock graph."
msgstr ""
"`use_sim_time` 为 true 时，`/clock` "
"是控制器的时间基准。每渲染一帧跳一次的时钟会一次跨过好几个物理步，定时动作就会提前结束。改用按物理步走的时钟。改关节增益修不好。新的进程内载荷沿用同一套"
" `ROS_Clock`。本页在 W2 上核对过。里程计图保留自己的 `ReadSimTime`（`resetOnStop=1`），这样 "
"`odom` 的时间戳仍然有效。相机放在场景载荷上，不要放在这个时钟图上。"

#: ../../source/4-reference/simulation/2-fasim_isaac.md:157
#: 95e74d26df7b4484852fc731cabc3e45
msgid ""
"`arms_target_manager`, when the node spawns it, is a host process with "
"`use_sim_time:=false` so markers are not tied to the physics step."
msgstr "节点若拉起 `arms_target_manager`，它是宿主机进程，`use_sim_time:=false`，标记不跟物理步绑定。"

#: ../../source/4-reference/simulation/2-fasim_isaac.md:161
#: 11a973191e7247ff8a7449f6dd9c051f
msgid "TF"
msgstr "TF"

#: ../../source/4-reference/simulation/2-fasim_isaac.md:163
#: 79ae53ca3a2d4bdc91a1d49cf47d73bf
msgid ""
"Isaac’s odometry graph publishes `world → odom → base_*` and `/odom`. It "
"does not publish the whole URDF tree. `robot_state_publisher` publishes "
"`base_footprint → base_link` (when both links exist) and the arm tree, "
"including fixed frames such as `right_eef`."
msgstr ""
"Isaac 的里程计图发布 `world → odom → base_*` 和 `/odom`。它不发布整棵 URDF "
"树。`robot_state_publisher` 发布 `base_footprint → "
"base_link`（两个连杆都存在时）以及手臂树，包括 `right_eef` 这类固定帧。"

#: ../../source/4-reference/simulation/2-fasim_isaac.md:165
#: 431de94e917a4beb81183328b1643567
msgid ""
"On in-process W2 the ArticulationRoot is `base_link` "
"(`/FiveAges_W2/base_link`). That payload’s odometry chain is `world → "
"odom → base_footprint`, and `robot_state_publisher` publishes "
"`base_footprint → base_link`. OCS2 `baseFrame` is the link named in that "
"planner’s `task.info`. `base_footprint` sits on the ground. `base_link` "
"can sit above it. Two publishers on one edge fight. A standing model with"
" no `base_footprint` uses `base_link` for that chain. Read the link names"
" in the robot’s USD and `task.info` before you copy the W2 names."
msgstr ""
"进程内 W2 的 ArticulationRoot 是 "
"`base_link`（`/FiveAges_W2/base_link`）。这份载荷的里程计链是 `world → odom → "
"base_footprint`，`robot_state_publisher` 发布 `base_footprint → "
"base_link`。OCS2 的 `baseFrame` 是这份规划器 `task.info` 里写的那根连杆。`base_footprint`"
" 贴地。`base_link` 可以在它上方。一条边上有两个发布者就会抢。没有 `base_footprint` 的站立模型，这条链用 "
"`base_link`。抄 W2 的名字之前，先看这台机器人 USD 和 `task.info` 里的连杆名。"

#: ../../source/4-reference/simulation/2-fasim_isaac.md:167
#: c88607882fa446b19a9abdfa9d0271f5
msgid "Several robots"
msgstr "多台机器人"

#: ../../source/4-reference/simulation/2-fasim_isaac.md:169
#: 7d0d8aa001fd40cd884edccf5c2f2e22
msgid ""
"One ArticulationRoot, one `ROS2ControlLaunch`, and one controller manager"
" per robot. Isolation is the graph `namespace` plus relative topic names "
"(`cmd_vel`, `fsm_command`, `robot_description`). `/clock` stays global."
msgstr ""
"每台机器人一个 ArticulationRoot、一个 `ROS2ControlLaunch`、一个控制器管理器。隔离靠图的 "
"`namespace` 加上相对话题名（`cmd_vel`、`fsm_command`、`robot_description`）。`/clock`"
" 保持全局。"

#: ../../source/4-reference/simulation/2-fasim_isaac.md:171
#: 8bf1889882974bee893ce696dfaae377
msgid ""
"A ROS namespace remaps topics (`/<ns>/tf`, `/<ns>/tf_static`). It does "
"not prefix `frame_id`. Each tree still has frames named `world`, `odom`, "
"and `base_link`. `world → odom` is that robot’s latched spawn pose on "
"**its** `/<ns>/tf`, not a rewritten frame called `g1d/world`. RViz "
"listens to `/tf` unless you remap it, for example:"
msgstr ""
"ROS 命名空间会重映射话题（`/<ns>/tf`、`/<ns>/tf_static`）。它不会给 `frame_id` "
"加前缀。每棵树里的帧名仍是 `world`、`odom` 和 `base_link`。`world → odom` 是这台机器人在**自己的** "
"`/<ns>/tf` 上锁存的出生位姿，不是改名为 `g1d/world` 的帧。RViz 默认听 `/tf`，需要时再重映射，例如："

#: ../../source/4-reference/simulation/2-fasim_isaac.md:173
#: 7117ec6d344441bfaaaad93969c6219b
msgid ""
"ros2 run tf2_ros tf2_echo world base_link --ros-args \\\n"
"  -r /tf:=/<ns>/tf -r /tf_static:=/<ns>/tf_static"
msgstr ""
"ros2 run tf2_ros tf2_echo world base_link --ros-args \\\n"
"  -r /tf:=/<ns>/tf -r /tf_static:=/<ns>/tf_static"

#: ../../source/4-reference/simulation/2-fasim_isaac.md:178
#: 9a2b6beb8d8e42d78cb90d7814472057
msgid ""
"`<ns>` is the string on that graph’s `namespace` input, not a "
"`demo.launch.py` argument. A stage with one graph and one controller "
"manager per robot has been run."
msgstr ""
"`<ns>` 是该图 `namespace` 输入上的字符串，不是 `demo.launch.py` "
"的参数。一个舞台、每台机器人一张图和一个控制器管理器，已经跑通过。"

#: ../../source/4-reference/simulation/2-fasim_isaac.md:182
#: 88d84caa017a4401a1d3a8c95c37c13c
msgid "Navigation"
msgstr "Navigation"

#: ../../source/4-reference/simulation/2-fasim_isaac.md:184
#: 5513789bb1b649958f0c8693bd2bd97a
msgid ""
"`NavigationLaunch` ([`OgnNavigationLaunch.ogn`](https://github.com"
"/fiveages-sim/FaSim-"
"Isaac/blob/main/exts/fasim.ros2.nodes/fasim/ros2/nodes/ogn/python/nodes/OgnNavigationLaunch.ogn))"
" starts `ros2 launch robot_common_launch navigation_isaac_gt.launch.py` "
"on Play when `enabled` is true. W2’s fiveages graph leaves `enabled` "
"false."
msgstr ""
"`NavigationLaunch`（[`OgnNavigationLaunch.ogn`](https://github.com"
"/fiveages-sim/FaSim-"
"Isaac/blob/main/exts/fasim.ros2.nodes/fasim/ros2/nodes/ogn/python/nodes/OgnNavigationLaunch.ogn)）在"
" `enabled` 为 true 时，于播放后启动 `ros2 launch robot_common_launch "
"navigation_isaac_gt.launch.py`。W2 的 fiveages 图把 `enabled` 留为 false。"

#: ../../source/4-reference/simulation/2-fasim_isaac.md:186
#: 1d6eff2023894524aadb0c95e7a3d564
msgid ""
"`map` and `paramsFile` are paths relative to the opened stage root, so an"
" `env/` layer can point at `../../maps/<name>/map.yaml` stored in the "
"same [fa-project-usd](https://github.com/fiveages-sim/fa-project-usd) "
"project. The node does not call composer `ros2-stack`. Default "
"`nav2Profile` is `map_only`. `publishMapWorldTf` defaults true (map drawn"
" in USD world). `publishMapOdomTf` defaults false because odometry comes "
"from Isaac."
msgstr ""
"`map` 和 `paramsFile` 相对已打开的舞台根解析，因此 `env/` 层可以指向同一 [fa-project-"
"usd](https://github.com/fiveages-sim/fa-project-usd) 项目里的 "
"`../../maps/<name>/map.yaml`。该节点不调用编排器的 `ros2-stack`。默认 `nav2Profile` 是 "
"`map_only`。`publishMapWorldTf` 默认 true（地图画在 USD 世界里）。`publishMapOdomTf` "
"默认 false，因为里程计来自 Isaac。"

#: ../../source/4-reference/simulation/2-fasim_isaac.md:188
#: a43ee2f5f2074ebea6ab35b7b24f04a8
msgid ""
"Where those map files and `robot.yaml` currently live: [Environment "
"assets](5-env_assets.md#fa-project-usd)."
msgstr "这些地图文件和 `robot.yaml` 目前在：[环境资产](5-env_assets.md#fa-project-usd)。"

#: ../../source/4-reference/simulation/2-fasim_isaac.md:192
#: d1787a6146a6474092fa428cd0592170
msgid "Layout"
msgstr "Layout"

#: ../../source/4-reference/simulation/2-fasim_isaac.md:194
#: d5c2cb703e4f4410ab7fa68497c5b0a9
msgid ""
"FaSim-Isaac/\n"
"├── init.sh\n"
"├── run.sh\n"
"├── run_headless.sh\n"
"├── config/                         # fa_sim.conf + optional "
"fa_sim.local.conf\n"
"├── exts/fasim.ros2.nodes/          # ROS2ControlLaunch, NavigationLaunch"
"\n"
"├── exts/fasim.steering.nodes/      # SwerveController\n"
"├── tools/audit_mimic_joint_drives.py\n"
"├── robots/                         # → robot_usds\n"
"└── environment/\n"
"    ├── fiveages_env/\n"
"    ├── fa-project-usd/             # private\n"
"    ├── artvip-usd/\n"
"    └── labutopia-usd/              # private"
msgstr ""
"FaSim-Isaac/\n"
"├── init.sh\n"
"├── run.sh\n"
"├── run_headless.sh\n"
"├── config/                         # fa_sim.conf + optional "
"fa_sim.local.conf\n"
"├── exts/fasim.ros2.nodes/          # ROS2ControlLaunch, NavigationLaunch"
"\n"
"├── exts/fasim.steering.nodes/      # swerve graph node\n"
"├── tools/audit_mimic_joint_drives.py\n"
"├── robots/                         # → robot_usds\n"
"└── environment/\n"
"    ├── fiveages_env/\n"
"    ├── fa-project-usd/             # private\n"
"    ├── artvip-usd/\n"
"    └── labutopia-usd/"

#: ../../source/4-reference/simulation/2-fasim_isaac.md:211
